        "slc_870cd9d132b59e114ead6a9ec75f3a187fdc452d9f02f88b6c30f3e871a0f1e8"
      ],
      "text": "The book covers controlling Claude Code via slash commands, persistent memory files, and lifecycle hooks for automating development tasks."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_774edcad2b1ed0593af3dcd5ce780b6ae055a3ff4f1e1640ef3098ae236838e0",
