        "slc_bc8efef918f4c4841baacffe339056dcaf90103d023a804252de2c5314304842"
      ],
      "text": "Some chapters require the GitHub CLI, GitHub repositories, and GitHub Actions; later sections involve local and remote MCP servers and running Claude Code within Cursor and the Claude desktop application."
    },
